{"ID":"20231122153031-2o50hzg","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20231122153031-2o50hzg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122153031-2o50hzg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122160629-62di5lz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122160629-nw4r4j6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122160629-nw4r4j6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"第五十七篇 经络论","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20231122160629-62di5lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-62di5lz","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原文】"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-6xjk36a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-6xjk36a","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问曰：夫络脉之见也，其五色各异，青、黄、赤、白、黑不同，其故何也？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-fq6jyst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-fq6jyst","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对曰：经有常色，而络无常变也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-fwm386a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-fwm386a","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：经之常色何如？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-385mh3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-385mh3n","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：心赤、肺白、肝青、脾黄、肾黑，皆亦应其经脉之色也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-ydp3sa4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-ydp3sa4","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：络之阴阳，亦应其经乎？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-943v1as","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-943v1as","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：阴络之色应其经，阳络之色变无常，随四时而行也。寒多则凝泣，凝泣则青黑；热多则淖泽，淖泽则黄赤。此皆常色，谓之无病。五色具见者，谓之寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-uqjz6dq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-uqjz6dq","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：善。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-mj1q70r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-mj1q70r","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【译文】"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-qrwrw81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-qrwrw81","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝问道：络脉显露在外面，五色各不相同，有青、黄、赤、白、黑的不同，这是什么缘故呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-qnv0roj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-qnv0roj","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯回答说：经脉的颜色经常不变，而络脉则没有常色，常随四时之气变而变。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-wnt52yp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-wnt52yp","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝说：经脉的常色是怎样的呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-xbpy2xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-xbpy2xs","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：心主赤，肺主白，肝主青，脾主黄，肾主黑，这些都是与其所属经脉的常色相应的。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-li2x8lv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-li2x8lv","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝说：阴络与阳络，也与其经脉的主色相应吗？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-kjhvv8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-kjhvv8x","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：阴络的颜色与其经脉相应，阳络的颜色则变化无常，它是随着四时的变化而变化的。寒气多时则气血运行迟滞，因而多出现青黑之色；热气多时则气血运行滑利，因而多出现黄赤的颜色。这都是正常的，是无病的表现。如果是五色全部显露，那就是过寒或过热所引起的变化，是疾病的表现。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160629-nw4r4j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160629-nw4r4j6","updated":"20231122160629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝说：好。"}]}]}